{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9fd352d441eb168c2bb1859b2a76cc49e2b34ddb92acc830fd4bb594bc870029", "ja": "（今日はこれから、次の定期公演の打ち合わせがある。\n琴葉の新曲も届いたし、準備万端だな！）", "zh": "（今天接下来要开下一场定期公演的筹备会。\n琴叶的新歌也送到了，准备万全！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "68278078232d694bf95e0080a8c2339dbd9703ffb17edfa92969c839e68b0816", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "77aa0dfd2f1e73efed8245f205f4bd46d727ac7598f7b8050b5767519bb310cc", "ja": "おっす、{$P$}！\nこのあとミーティングだろ？　迎えに来たぜ♪", "zh": "嗨，{$P$}！\n接下来要开会吧？我来接你啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a35f872710d7e36d024acd7643fe5b7ec30ac20e011898a45f77a774b08c17cc", "ja": "おっ、志保、昴。ありがとうな。\nそれじゃ、行こうか！", "zh": "哦，志保、昴。谢谢你们。\n那我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1004_p", "source_sha256": "865a028e015dd171a8079c180a31ece3b9b54f8147a89f5235828939160f1cfe", "ja": "お疲れ様！\nみんな、もう揃ってたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n大家已经到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "3dae5e590d969d9f5b669e983f575009b0a7da6f4c6ba5d1336f8bbde928fb58", "ja": "{$P$}！\n志保ちゃん、昴ちゃんも、お疲れさま。", "zh": "{$P$}！\n志保、昴，你们也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5f84ff3652bafbcc3a299ced04300433df761c2d3a2567b2eef596695e13d638", "ja": "それじゃ、次回定期公演のミーティングを始めよう。\n今回は、琴葉の新曲お披露目がメインだ。", "zh": "那么，我们开始下次定期公演的会议吧。\n这次主要是为琴叶展示新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "d88f4bcc48c66db34e1810fbad33c730fe1e0cc4e6538fe235a0ddb2e3af7713", "ja": "は、はいっ！　あの、精いっぱい努めるので……\nみんな、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "是、是的！那个，我会竭尽全力的……\n还请大家多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "2fb5dd13e6a5031ed9cf2ac96596df1329a2fc1e9e87b0ad3be5064735eb2343", "ja": "琴葉、カタいって～。別にそんな改まった\n言い方しなくても、大丈夫だってば！", "zh": "琴叶，你太拘谨啦～没必要说得那么正式，没关系的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "94a3f835f5c7ce00bb3070fb465d78d895d4bdb16cd24cc1e063525b86398c9d", "ja": "そ、そうかな……？", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "38c016cd7de554a3cedf3ddd83b3886c453489b0fb66992cd201de1214a9c5e9", "ja": "私も昴さんも、琴葉さんにはお世話になってますし。\n気にしないでください。", "zh": "我和昴都承蒙琴叶照顾了。\n请别在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "6ac300ed2b77f897c1f92eb55f2d13bba360d119f42ecb652c1c0a1e6e03cd45", "ja": "そうだよ、琴葉！　遠慮なんかしないで、\n何かあったらすぐ、ボクたちに相談してね。", "zh": "没错，琴叶！别客气，\n有什么事就马上来找我们商量哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ab75ee4af205a520d824eac4437bca1a5c61d2a01bf76bd0f7ae4f81118bf88", "ja": "みんな……うん、そうだね。\nありがとう！", "zh": "大家……嗯，说得对。\n谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "be992a00b56a1b409c67e2e3bef65e18c430f1f33149ed3809a23cc5107782d2", "ja": "さて、それじゃそろそろ本題に入りましょうか。\n琴葉の新曲が届いたんですよね？", "zh": "那么，差不多该进入正题了吧。\n琴叶的新歌已经送到了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1014_p", "source_sha256": "153bfef69a5e6abf871c0851ed975f42cb740ad3a2cce6061b8a31d9a25c8be8", "ja": "ああ。早速、流してみよう！", "zh": "嗯。马上放来听听吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "d9416c98153eaf18af7963cb232570f16bdf91dea675366b93192968e92c2c74", "ja": "素敵な曲……。\n本当に、私が歌っていいんですか？", "zh": "好棒的歌……真的可以让我来唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1017_p", "source_sha256": "de88ab5717cca3ab9145ef068cec4883fa21b351dba62db75d19f4923fa3e583", "ja": "もちろん！　琴葉のために作った曲だからな。", "zh": "当然了！这首歌就是为了琴叶而写的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "df9b502e7ba63db0ba876216d5e221241c6ae963eaa5a2508cb6b01c9483b8f8", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……やっぱり、{$P$}はすごいな。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n……{$P$}果然好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "3252129d3f21cb460f61e8b0fd2f09f02ab9750ea4255ab7e8aa00b4bdd80226", "ja": "え？　すごいって、何が？", "zh": "诶？你说厉害，具体是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "561eb963a986d770150b30aa4106f856f571c5ba947ec1a5c8da4df312082de7", "ja": "あっ、えっと。この前のエレナの新曲公演を見て、\n改めて思ったことなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我看了前阵子的艾莲娜新歌公演后，又重新想起了一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "5701777396b6c26fad3200f1358d3da7f606a62079b34022019b0777346d8508", "ja": "私、ふたりとは友達だけど。\n恵美もエレナも、あんな顔、初めて見たな……って。", "zh": "我和她们俩是朋友，但是……\n恵美也好，エレナ也好，那样的表情，我还是第一次见到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "deccf6057ecb39b5d28071ae4a57aeef7bdaff813186bc4ef25767f6e7e8ca34", "ja": "そうだよね。ふたりとも恋の歌だったけど、\nすっごく大人っぽい曲だった！", "zh": "是啊。虽然两个人唱的都是恋爱歌曲，但曲子都特别成熟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "995b342e563cb5408c7233228b43e9fbaa98bbf9fc8ade3c9dda88c287f1b416", "ja": "エレナの曲も、恵美の曲も、それぞれ\nふたりの新しい魅力が引き出されてるから。", "zh": "因为无论是艾丽娜的歌，还是惠美的歌，都展现出了她们各自全新的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "faafb5087c0f8a8d4baf34fd9cabb7c2c8487af8c6216752d04ac2b7cf037e12", "ja": "だから、それができる{$P$}は、\nやっぱりすごいと思って……。", "zh": "所以，我觉得能做到这一点的{$P$}，果然很厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "8286e6e18c0a364ba48157b34cbd3af160253ea2a17dbe4e1e77f94a5c21738b", "ja": "なるほど。つまり琴葉は、{$P$}の\nプロデュース力に感心したってわけね。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，琴叶是对{$P$}的制作能力感到佩服了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "2dfe3ac956e8aaa4bd9442bd8691e2efe4ec592831750f71a1cc9f043cccf0ce", "ja": "プロデューサー冥利に尽きますね、\n{$P$}殿？", "zh": "真是不枉做制作人呢，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1027_p", "source_sha256": "20d554270cbfc1eacf287e2fe869ac509b331b404c364e06bc3d54bc456527b7", "ja": "律子……からかわないでくれ。それに俺の力じゃなく、\n恵美とエレナの努力があったからこそ、だよ。", "zh": "律子……别拿我开玩笑了。而且这也不是多亏了我，\n而是多亏了惠美和艾莲娜自身的努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "093b903a0877017fe1f98bea575f72fb4d9841f0eb5ac9e58188b5df8a14771f", "ja": "は、はい！　そうですよね。恵美もエレナも、\nふたりが努力したから……あんな風に……。", "zh": "是、是啊！确实是这样。惠美和艾蕾娜也是因为两个人付出了努力……才能那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "e924facd56f7202bebd92768a8445a5f0e41a48abd6d78ba4a91d95740ff7469", "ja": "私も、がんばらなくちゃ。\nふたりに、負けないように……！", "zh": "我也得努力才行。不能输给她们两个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "6a41b2944739b1523efccf398726705867f63ffa74f708b848a993fb2df4216e", "ja": "？　琴葉……？", "zh": "？　琴叶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_095_1031_p", "source_sha256": "75f9b8aeba234c40a6e4bad15504f0425f679590e539c3f2274eeaed22c9dab2", "ja": "（琴葉のやる気は十分だな。少し気負いすぎている\n気もするけど……しばらく様子を見るか）", "zh": "（琴叶干劲十足啊。虽然感觉她有点太过紧绷了……还是先观察一阵子吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
